      "date": "2026-04-23T12:06:35.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹24.64 (vs ₹24.09 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹24.64 (up from ₹24.09 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.12t (down 4.0% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹24.7b (up 2.4% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.2% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 17% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Insurance industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 14% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
