      "title": "SBILIFE: Fair View Will Weigh Rich P/E Against Upcoming Board Decisions",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target for SBI Life Insurance higher from about ₹1,855 to roughly ₹1,880, citing updated assumptions that combine a higher revenue growth outlook with a slightly lower projected profit margin and a reduced future P/E of around 72x. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for Jan 28, 2026 to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025 (company filing).",
