      "body": "Analysts have lifted the fair value estimate for SBI Life Insurance from ₹2,500 to ₹2,850, pointing to revised assumptions around discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E as the key drivers of the change. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for Jan 28, 2026, to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025 (company event filing).",
