      "title": "SBILIFE: Stable Outlook Will Balance Rich P/E And Upcoming Board Decisions",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value target for SBI Life Insurance steady at ₹1,855.27, citing only small refinements to long term revenue growth, profit margin assumptions and future P/E expectations rather than a change in overall view. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled on Jan 28, 2026 to consider and approve audited financial results for the quarter and nine months ended Dec 31, 2025 (company event filing).",
