      "date": "2026-02-28T21:39:52.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹2.70 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.70 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 6th March 2026 Payment date: 27th March 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.1%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (11% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (0.8393% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 3.8% per year over the past 8 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 56% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
